# Fixture: MAGNET (X-Plane 1110+ VR tablet / flashlight mount point).
# XPlane2Blender has no field for it, so it has to ride an object's custom
# attributes to survive the round trip.  The type field repeats on purpose -
# "xpad|flashlight" is one token with a pipe in it, not two parameters.
TEXTURE	mini.png
POINT_COUNTS	4 0 0 2

VT	0	0	0	0	1	0	0	0
VT	1	0	0	0	1	0	1	0
VT	1	0	1	0	1	0	1	1
VT	0	0	1	0	1	0	0	1
IDX	0 1 2 0 2 3
MAGNET	yoke	xpad|flashlight	0	0	0.5	0	0	0
TRIS	0	6
